WEBVTT

00:06.960 --> 00:08.460
Arthur Bersford.

00:09.250 --> 00:12.380
That's my name, given to me by my mom and dad.

00:14.750 --> 00:17.250
My dad, who is also known as "The Untouchable Knight",

00:17.630 --> 00:20.420
has been my inspiration ever since I was small.

00:21.960 --> 00:26.330
As a child, I was enthusiastic about
becoming a knight, just like my dad.

00:27.500 --> 00:30.790
My dad is a special ability user,
with the ability of Slash Nullification.

00:31.250 --> 00:35.630
Just as the nickname suggests,
he's never been wounded by a sword.

00:36.460 --> 00:41.540
I used to think that I would like
to someday become like my father.

00:49.670 --> 00:53.630
When I realized my own ability of
making crops grow nice and hardy,

00:54.170 --> 00:58.290
I was simply happy that I was
a special ability user like my dad.

01:00.830 --> 01:02.000
That's amazing, Arthur!

01:04.130 --> 01:07.540
But the others had a different reaction.

01:08.790 --> 01:10.170
It's quite the shame.

01:11.250 --> 01:11.920
Huh?

01:13.250 --> 01:16.540
I gave up on my journey to becoming a knight.

01:19.790 --> 01:24.920
No matter how much I trained, even if I practiced
until I died, my special ability remained the same.

01:26.040 --> 01:30.420
I decided to abandon my dream of becoming a knight
and make a living as a farmer... or so I thought.

01:31.920 --> 01:33.420
Until I met her...

03:13.750 --> 03:15.750
You're back late, scumbag Dad!

03:16.330 --> 03:18.000
You... your hair...

03:18.630 --> 03:20.460
It's easier to move when I tie it up.

03:20.880 --> 03:21.630
Makes sense.

03:22.920 --> 03:24.960
Did you sleep properly?

03:25.290 --> 03:28.290
Yeah, but since I woke up early for some reason,

03:28.580 --> 03:30.790
I did warm ups while I was waiting for you.

03:31.130 --> 03:31.880
Oh?

03:32.210 --> 03:35.630
More importantly, can YOU really do
a proper practice right now?

03:35.630 --> 03:37.080
What do you mean by that?

03:37.420 --> 03:40.380
You were drinking with Clark, right?

03:40.380 --> 03:41.830
It was just a pint.

03:42.540 --> 03:45.830
Liar. Just a pint makes you reek of alcohol?

03:46.580 --> 03:49.210
It's the perfect amount to warm me up.

03:49.580 --> 03:50.290
Let's go.

03:59.670 --> 04:00.670
Wow.

04:01.000 --> 04:03.710
Quit gaping and give me a real fight!

04:07.380 --> 04:10.790
By the way, what kind of person is Princess Pride?

04:11.210 --> 04:13.330
Huh? Are you interested in her?

04:14.080 --> 04:15.080
Well...

04:19.170 --> 04:23.290
I mean, of course I'm interested in someone that strong!

04:29.420 --> 04:30.330
Tch...

04:31.500 --> 04:34.420
<b>"The Wicked Princess and the Sword"</b>

04:31.710 --> 04:34.130
Darn, I can't win!

04:35.460 --> 04:41.170
Arthur... have you really not trained
with the sword up until now?

04:41.540 --> 04:44.290
What? Is that sarcasm? You know, don't you?

04:44.920 --> 04:48.540
Yes, you're right. I can't believe it...

04:48.540 --> 04:49.380
What?

04:49.710 --> 04:52.000
I knew you were more talented than I.

04:53.130 --> 04:57.710
Oh? You two sure are up early. What are you doing?

04:58.670 --> 05:01.210
Yeah, I'm training to become a knight.

05:01.580 --> 05:03.080
Eh? A knight?

05:03.380 --> 05:04.420
Uh, er...

05:04.750 --> 05:08.670
Arthur will become a knight?
Did something happen? Why?

05:09.040 --> 05:11.710
I have to head to the castle now.

05:12.540 --> 05:17.250
Rodrick?! Wait, something really
happened, didn't it?! Hey!

05:17.250 --> 05:18.830
Well then, Arthur, see you later!

05:21.130 --> 05:23.580
Hey, Dad! Don't run away!

05:23.580 --> 05:24.540
Goodness.

05:26.130 --> 05:27.580
Stupid Dad.

05:31.710 --> 05:35.710
The area that cliff was in was originally
a place with unstable ground.

05:36.380 --> 05:41.040
There, in one way or another,
my father would have probably lost his life.

05:41.500 --> 05:47.670
However, him being cast aside like that... It's so cruel!

05:52.830 --> 05:54.000
Please don't touch me.

05:56.080 --> 06:00.460
I don't want to be touched by someone who has
the same blood running through her as that woman.

06:07.750 --> 06:11.580
Pride... Pride. Pride.

06:13.080 --> 06:14.630
You were zoning out.

06:16.500 --> 06:21.330
Uh... Yeah, well... I was just wondering
if Arthur was doing well.

06:21.710 --> 06:24.630
I'm sure Lord Arthur is all right.

06:25.080 --> 06:28.960
I agree. You did so much for him, after all.

06:30.460 --> 06:33.880
In the near future, you will become an honorable knight.

06:34.080 --> 06:37.750
A strong knight that not only I,
but everyone will recognize.

06:39.540 --> 06:43.920
I'm pleased that I was able to encourage him.

06:44.500 --> 06:46.210
What are you saying?

06:46.960 --> 06:50.000
Have more pride in the things you've done!

06:50.420 --> 06:52.460
You're incredible, Big Sister!

06:53.460 --> 06:54.710
Oh, you two...

06:55.960 --> 06:57.000
Besides...

06:57.830 --> 07:03.380
I want Lord Arthur and I to have
an even deeper relationship.

07:12.420 --> 07:13.830
Princess Pride!

07:13.830 --> 07:16.170
And Prince Stale, and Princess Tiara, too!

07:16.330 --> 07:18.460
Wonderful to see you, Vice Captain.

07:18.830 --> 07:21.330
I apologize for the sudden visit.

07:21.830 --> 07:24.960
There's something I would like
to return to the captain today.

07:26.170 --> 07:30.920
Hey, someone call for Rodrick! Princess Pride is here!

07:31.290 --> 07:32.380
Princess Pride?!

07:32.830 --> 07:33.790
Quit pushing, dummy!

07:33.790 --> 07:34.330
Ow!

07:34.330 --> 07:35.000
Princess Pride is here?!

07:35.000 --> 07:35.750
I got here first!

07:38.080 --> 07:40.670
Princess Pride! What brings you here today?

07:41.080 --> 07:43.790
Princess Pride, my name is Alan, and-

07:43.790 --> 07:46.000
That is intensely disrespectful to the First Princess!

07:46.170 --> 07:48.330
Excuse me, if I could just have one bout with you...

07:48.330 --> 07:50.130
Idiot! They told us to keep that stuff secret!

07:50.130 --> 07:51.080
Oh, right!

07:52.750 --> 07:53.880
Stale, help...

07:54.080 --> 07:56.880
Just as expected of my Elder Sister.
She's extremely popular.

07:57.250 --> 07:58.920
That's not what I meant...

08:09.080 --> 08:12.580
Princess Pride, I apologize for keeping you waiting.

08:15.710 --> 08:19.250
His forehead... He must have
just smacked it on something.

08:19.710 --> 08:22.790
Oh no, I really want to ask him about his forehead...

08:26.920 --> 08:30.920
I'm sorry that you must see me in such
an unsightly manner, Princess Pride.

08:35.250 --> 08:36.080
It's all right.

08:36.210 --> 08:42.540
The Captain is still in need of rest and repose, but
he insisted on at least taking part in the military drills.

08:42.750 --> 08:43.750
It's just...

08:45.830 --> 08:48.080
he drank far too much yesterday.

08:48.540 --> 08:51.040
On top of that, early this morning
he was once again training with his son,

08:51.040 --> 08:53.750
and then came to the practice field...

08:54.080 --> 08:56.040
And, that's why you see the mess before you.

08:57.170 --> 08:59.080
He's been resting in the back.

08:59.080 --> 09:00.000
Clark!

09:00.540 --> 09:03.380
This is exactly why parents who are crazy about
their kids are so much trouble, you know.

09:03.630 --> 09:06.460
You drank until the sun came up, same as I did.

09:07.040 --> 09:10.460
Arthur started his training right away, didn't he?

09:11.250 --> 09:15.420
Yes. He was waiting and prepared
for it first thing this morning.

09:15.880 --> 09:17.540
My wife was shocked as well.

09:17.540 --> 09:18.670
Oh, really?

09:19.580 --> 09:24.250
He was so skilled with the sword I found it hard
to believe it's been several years since he last...

09:28.420 --> 09:29.290
Don't laugh!

09:30.580 --> 09:34.170
Everyone's happy to see you acting
like a father crazy about their child.

09:35.630 --> 09:37.920
Right. And speaking of...

09:38.380 --> 09:39.210
Yes?

09:39.210 --> 09:42.580
Well, this can also be said of all of our knights, but...

09:43.130 --> 09:45.750
this morning my son was talking
about you, Princess Pride...

09:45.750 --> 09:46.920
You stupid father!

09:47.330 --> 09:49.580
What the hell are you talking about?!

09:50.250 --> 09:52.500
Why are you on the training grounds?

09:52.500 --> 09:56.790
You left and forgot to take this with you so out of the
goodness of my heart I came to give it to you, you jerk!

09:57.170 --> 09:59.080
You owe me a hundred apologies, you stupid father!

09:59.880 --> 10:04.380
Ah, so I really did leave it behind.Thanks.

10:04.670 --> 10:06.460
You got too drunk, you scumbag dad!

10:11.960 --> 10:15.790
P-P... Princess Pride?! Y-yesterday was a-

10:16.170 --> 10:18.330
Arthur, hello.

10:18.920 --> 10:20.960
I'm happy you seem to be doing so well.

10:23.290 --> 10:24.170
Thank you.

10:33.540 --> 10:36.040
Well then... I'll be leaving now.

10:37.170 --> 10:43.170
Whoa, Arthur. Don't you have something else to say
to Princess Pride since you've come all the way here?

10:43.630 --> 10:46.830
Shut up, Clark! One more word and I'll deck you!

10:49.040 --> 10:53.250
I'll tell her... after I become a knight.

10:56.290 --> 10:57.290
Please wait.

11:03.170 --> 11:08.790
If you have the time, would you mind
joining me at my training after this?

11:09.250 --> 11:11.750
Prince Stale, why in the world...

11:12.040 --> 11:15.330
Well, I'm also in need of a partner for my training.

11:17.130 --> 11:20.000
If you will, Lord Arthur...

11:24.130 --> 11:24.920
Me?

11:25.420 --> 11:30.460
Yes. And if it's all right with you,
then perhaps it can become a regular thing.

11:30.750 --> 11:33.250
It will benefit the both of us by making us stronger.

11:36.750 --> 11:37.630
Stronger...

11:50.500 --> 11:53.630
Oh, that's right! Big Sister, here.

11:54.500 --> 11:55.670
Thanks, Tiara!

11:57.330 --> 12:00.710
This is the coat I borrowed the other day.
Thank you so much.

12:01.170 --> 12:02.630
O-oh...

12:16.250 --> 12:17.710
Don't laugh at me!

12:18.170 --> 12:18.920
Right.

12:20.330 --> 12:21.250
Pride?

12:22.290 --> 12:23.380
Good bye!

12:24.960 --> 12:27.710
Say one more word about that incident
and it's over for you!

12:28.080 --> 12:29.420
Of course, Princess.

12:33.830 --> 12:37.790
Er... so, this is the place?

12:38.330 --> 12:39.000
Yes.

12:39.330 --> 12:42.000
You can also use whichever weapon
displayed here that you'd like to.

12:42.420 --> 12:43.330
Oh...

12:48.920 --> 12:51.580
Lord Arthur, is something wrong?

12:52.000 --> 12:53.580
Uh... No.

12:54.130 --> 12:56.170
Please, there's no need to be nervous.

12:57.250 --> 13:00.920
Something's real suspicious about this guy's smile.

13:01.250 --> 13:02.670
It's uncanny.

13:05.330 --> 13:08.580
There's no one here but me and you, after all.

13:09.210 --> 13:12.460
Er, you can drop the formal speech.

13:12.460 --> 13:13.040
Huh?

13:13.330 --> 13:19.290
I'm not someone the First Prince should
be speaking to like that, you know.

13:19.670 --> 13:23.170
And that goes for "Lord" Arthur, too.

13:23.540 --> 13:26.880
Then you don't need to use official titles
or formal language with me either.

13:27.170 --> 13:30.210
You're way older than me anyways, Lord Arthur.

13:30.210 --> 13:31.040
What?!

13:31.330 --> 13:33.790
That doesn't make any sense!

13:34.330 --> 13:37.040
Then I'll be the first to stop speaking formally.

13:37.460 --> 13:42.080
And if it's okay that you think of me
as your friend, then you can do it too.

13:42.080 --> 13:43.830
Hey, no need to go that far...

13:44.290 --> 13:47.920
Just for now, I will also face you forthrightly.

13:50.750 --> 13:51.460
Arthur.

13:51.830 --> 13:53.380
That's easier said than done...

13:55.170 --> 13:56.080
Whoa!

13:58.670 --> 14:00.460
I wasn't going to follow through with that strike.

14:01.040 --> 14:05.040
Arthur, did you really take a break
from training with the sword?

14:06.130 --> 14:08.830
I held a sword for the first time
in several years this morning.

14:10.460 --> 14:14.960
I really do want you to train with me. And,

14:15.420 --> 14:19.330
I want you to take the test to become
a new recruit for the knights next year.

14:19.710 --> 14:21.500
Uh... Wha?!

14:22.000 --> 14:26.500
No, I can't. I still don't know the basics of the sword at all.

14:26.920 --> 14:32.000
If I start preparing now, I may be able to take it
in about three years' time at the soonest.

14:32.210 --> 14:36.130
A person can very well take the test
more than once in their lives.

14:36.540 --> 14:38.460
If you don't pass next year, there's always the next one,

14:38.460 --> 14:40.960
and if you still don't pass
you can take it the following year.

14:40.960 --> 14:42.250
No, I already told you...

14:42.330 --> 14:44.040
I'll support you in every way I can.

14:44.670 --> 14:47.130
I want you to become a knight as soon as possible.

14:47.750 --> 14:52.130
What is he trying to do?
Why is the first prince of this country trying to...

14:54.210 --> 14:55.580
Can I ask you something?

14:55.880 --> 14:56.750
Go ahead.

14:57.500 --> 15:00.630
Why do you want me of all people
to become a knight so badly?

15:02.460 --> 15:03.920
So you can protect Elder Sister.

15:05.540 --> 15:08.750
As you know, my elder sister is strong.

15:09.130 --> 15:12.880
But to tell the truth, that incident was
her first time in actual combat.

15:13.790 --> 15:18.250
I'm positive that Elder Sister will do
reckless things like that in the future as well.

15:18.880 --> 15:21.790
Whenever it's within her power and reach.

15:23.630 --> 15:26.210
But that doesn't mean Elder Sister is invincible.

15:27.080 --> 15:28.960
I heard it straight from her earlier.

15:29.920 --> 15:33.000
"At any rate, I won't stand a chance
against those with pure strength."

15:33.880 --> 15:36.920
Elder Sister is a powerless, helpless woman.

15:37.460 --> 15:41.880
When I was adopted by the royal family,
Elder Sister was only 8 years old.

15:42.580 --> 15:48.130
From that time on, she was already
always afraid of something.

15:49.630 --> 15:53.040
When you judge me to be the enemy of
the people of this country...

15:53.920 --> 15:55.790
That's why I want to protect her.

15:56.210 --> 16:01.040
To do that, I learn what I can,
and I'm doing training with a sword. But...

16:01.750 --> 16:03.040
It's still not enough.

16:04.210 --> 16:08.080
When there's strength that surpasses
Elder Sister's, and pure power,

16:08.670 --> 16:11.250
and violence standing in the way,

16:11.960 --> 16:13.920
I can't protect her!

16:18.540 --> 16:21.250
Arthur, you will surely become strong.

16:21.710 --> 16:26.040
Stronger than me, than Elder Sister...
and stronger than anyone.

16:27.290 --> 16:28.460
What the hell is this?

16:29.000 --> 16:31.790
No matter how many times I'm told
I'm the son of the Captain of the Knights,

16:32.000 --> 16:34.420
I'm only holding the sword for
the first time in forever, and I...

16:34.830 --> 16:35.750
But...

16:36.460 --> 16:38.500
I'm looking forward to it, Arthur.

16:40.420 --> 16:42.380
I want to become a knight if I can.

16:43.290 --> 16:51.630
No, I have to. One that's stronger than anyone
and can protect Princess Pride.

16:52.250 --> 16:54.630
I have two more... is that okay?

16:54.880 --> 16:55.750
Go ahead.

16:57.170 --> 17:00.500
Why are you being so supportive of me?

17:01.250 --> 17:06.830
And why are you working so desperately
for Princess Pride's sake?

17:08.040 --> 17:10.580
Because I think you're the same as I am.

17:11.040 --> 17:11.880
Huh?

17:12.250 --> 17:16.830
Because Elder Sister is the First Princess,
I am able to be who I am.

17:17.460 --> 17:23.880
I'm not able to share the details,
but I'll never forget what happened then.

17:26.250 --> 17:29.960
I made a vow, I swore to nobody but myself...

17:29.960 --> 17:34.540
that I would protect Elder Sister.
That I would continue to live for her sake.

17:35.710 --> 17:39.960
But I... I can't really trust anyone around us.

17:41.040 --> 17:43.880
However, I thought I could trust you.

17:44.330 --> 17:45.210
Huh?

17:45.210 --> 17:48.790
What you said back then were
your undeniably true feelings.

17:49.580 --> 17:52.420
I thought you were making a vow.

17:53.500 --> 17:56.880
Please! Let me protect you for my entire life!

17:58.250 --> 18:03.040
I will be a shield to protect Elder Sister
from the powerless and shapeless things.

18:03.750 --> 18:06.960
And Arthur, I want you to become the sword

18:06.960 --> 18:11.580
that will cut down and protect Elder Sister
from anyone who holds power over her.

18:13.290 --> 18:16.330
I get it now. That's what he meant.

18:16.830 --> 18:19.080
Do you think what I'm saying is a lie?

18:19.580 --> 18:22.380
Maybe this is a means to curry favor with you?

18:22.920 --> 18:28.170
Do you think I'm someone who will just
pull strings so I can exploit Elder Sister?

18:29.080 --> 18:31.130
I don't think that at all.

18:34.790 --> 18:39.330
It's all right. That last part is not a premonition.

18:41.000 --> 18:43.960
What do you owe to Princess Pride?

18:44.920 --> 18:49.710
Also, I have no idea whatsoever as to why you have
such high expectations of someone like me, but...

18:50.080 --> 18:53.580
But, I can believe that you want to protect Princess Pride.

18:54.960 --> 19:01.670
At any rate, that part was you being completely genuine.

19:02.250 --> 19:07.380
Ha! And you using those damn embarrassing
expressions like "shield" and "sword" and stuff.

19:07.750 --> 19:10.080
That stuff's why kids get on my nerves.

19:12.040 --> 19:12.920
But...

19:14.130 --> 19:20.830
using "sword" like that isn't so bad. Like I've been
saying, it's been a few years since I've held a sword.

19:21.330 --> 19:25.250
And if my becoming a knight doesn't go
as smoothly as you think it will,

19:25.250 --> 19:27.880
I don't wanna hear any lip from you, got it Stale?

19:27.880 --> 19:32.750
Right, of course not.
You'll become strong. I'll support you.

19:33.130 --> 19:37.290
And stop being so cordial!
Be more tough when you talk to me!

19:37.580 --> 19:41.460
Also, I'm not the only one who's gonna get stronger.

19:42.500 --> 19:46.290
You'll become strong too. For Princess Pride.

19:47.210 --> 19:51.080
What I learn from my father, and I guess what
I learn from the knights when I join them...

19:51.380 --> 19:54.580
everything I'm taught there I'll be teaching to you.

19:55.170 --> 19:57.000
So you teach me everything you know, too.

19:57.380 --> 19:58.670
There's a lot, right?

19:59.080 --> 20:03.420
Like the swordsmanship of the royal family, and
hand-to-hand combat for self-defense, and stuff like that.

20:03.670 --> 20:06.630
All right. Thanks, Arthur.

20:07.250 --> 20:10.380
Yeah. A-also...

20:12.080 --> 20:16.830
That forced, shady smile you had
when I saw you earlier? Quit that!

20:17.630 --> 20:22.250
Your regular face is fine. That smile is extremely creepy.

20:22.750 --> 20:26.630
Was it weird? I thought I had been doing fairly well...

20:27.040 --> 20:31.130
Hardly. That smile made me distrust you for no reason.

20:31.580 --> 20:34.460
No one's ever told me that before.

20:34.880 --> 20:43.880
Oh. My dad always has that unfriendly look, and
on the other hand, my mother is way too expressive,

20:44.500 --> 20:48.790
and I've seen more than enough expressions
on customers' faces, so I know a thing or two.

20:49.080 --> 20:50.000
I see.

20:52.250 --> 20:55.330
Don't act like a kid and get all weird about it.

20:58.460 --> 21:01.130
Okay then, which of us is gonna teach first?

21:04.250 --> 21:10.290
Arthur, it was such a pleasure to...
I mean, I'm glad I met you.

21:12.000 --> 21:16.040
No more embarassing lines from you!
Who are you, Clark?

21:25.130 --> 21:26.130
All right.

21:26.130 --> 21:27.000
Let's do this.

21:32.330 --> 21:33.000
Take that!

23:16.540 --> 23:18.210
Come out, you criminal.

23:20.000 --> 23:22.380
We're announcing your charges.

23:28.420 --> 23:34.000
"The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:
From Villainess to Savior."

23:34.790 --> 23:38.210
Episode 6: "The Selfish Princess Passes Judgment."

23:36.000 --> 23:40.960
<b>"The Selfish Princess Passes Judgment"</b>
